title: start
---
<<if not $goblin_menace_done>>
Scout Rowan: Behind you — there are still raiders on the road!
<<elseif not $restless_barrow_done>>
Scout Rowan: You came back for me. Take my rune.
Scout Rowan: Runebreak sends a wave through an enemy mid-swing. Use it when the ground turns red.
Scout Rowan: Follow the blue light into the woods, and stop the channelers.
<<else>>
Scout Rowan: The rune serves you well. Keep Ember close; they hate the fox.
<<endif>>
